{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2026-08", "window": 4, "start_date": 1787529600, "end_date": 1788220799, "month_true_total": 101, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:08:54 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "234182931", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041992576", "personaname": "DemonDank", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DemonDan1999/", "num_games_owned": 432, "num_reviews": 161, "playtime_forever": 3332, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3332, "last_played": 1788202939, "avatar": "d115a523206ccef705f69b61b5b8ef44c01c1db9"}, "language": "english", "review": "is good", "timestamp_created": 1788202949, "timestamp_updated": 1788202949, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517241418361663818", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "234052389", "author": {"steamid": "76561198233531188", "personaname": "HSD.", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198233531188/", "num_games_owned": 1087, "num_reviews": 1002, "playtime_forever": 630, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 630, "last_played": 1788065126, "avatar": "3f12c7dde24b7e016142e8acacc9df422f39e274"}, "language": "english", "review": "Space Marine offers up a decent amount of third person action and tries to offer something new. As a first attempt to a brand new franchise it does everything pretty well and no doubt ticks most of the boxes laid out during its development but it's a shame that certain areas such as the melee combat weren't given a bit more depth.\n\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3791694384", "timestamp_created": 1788069601, "timestamp_updated": 1788069636, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "234037651", "author": {"steamid": "76561198066991194", "personaname": "Josuke", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198066991194/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 49, "playtime_forever": 333, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 333, "last_played": 1788051868, "avatar": "b28130618cf2bad6bb5f172c55a4c8f15d09e461"}, "language": "english", "review": "Genuinely some of the most fun I've had per hour of gameplay ever. Space Marine is the perfect combination of Halo, DOOM, and Gears of War, with a truly well done unique 40K twist on top. It gives you power fantasy of being a Space Marine, while also doing a great job of telling a story and immersing you in the world. The way it shows off the depth of power scaling in lore is SO well done. The amount of epic fights, fun new toys, and cool story sequences there are in this game blows my mind. It's just one awesome thing to another constantly, without any wasted grinding or boring time. This game REALLY benefits from how linear it is, allowing everything to feel handcrafted, and I really enjoyed having a game that wasn't 200 hours long! Can't recommend enough to fans of 40K.", "timestamp_created": 1788052370, "timestamp_updated": 1788052370, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "234030736", "author": {"steamid": "76561199516561947", "personaname": "generic101", "